{"id":"115b0689f1a67703","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md","title":"Conditional Strictness of Finite Consistency Iterations","display":"thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy — Conditional Strictness of Finite Consistency Iterations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy","aliases":["92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy — Conditional Strictness of Finite Consistency Iterations","source":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；条件层级推论为本地扩展","source_status":"本地扩展；原书仅提供所用不完备性工具","depends_on":["[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]","[[92-df-theory-system]]","[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy — Conditional Strictness of Finite Consistency Iterations"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；条件层级推论为本地扩展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地扩展；原书仅提供所用不完备性工具"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" href=\"?note=3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" title=\"92-df-iterated-consistency\">92-df-iterated-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cb62be5b9aab48d1\" href=\"?note=cb62be5b9aab48d1\" title=\"92-df-diagonalizable-system\">92-df-diagonalizable-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1f22fd0f606ee7bd\" href=\"?note=1f22fd0f606ee7bd\" title=\"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{T^{(n)}}\">\\(B_{T^{(n)}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" href=\"?note=3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" title=\"92-df-iterated-consistency\">92-df-iterated-consistency</a>的所选迭代。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n=\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})\">\\(\\mathcal S_n=\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n=\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)=\\neg\\Box_{B_{T^{(n)}}}\\bot_G\">\\(C_n=\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)=\\neg\\Box_{B_{T^{(n)}}}\\bot_G\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G\\)</span> 分别为外部相容性、P1–P3 与内部固定点性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S_n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S_n}(B_{T^{(n)}})\\land\n\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S_n))\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\nT^{(n)}\\subsetneq T^{(n+1)}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal S_n\\nvdash C_n\n\\land\\mathcal S_{n+1}\\vdash C_n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S_n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S_n}(B_{T^{(n)}})\\land\n\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S_n))\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\nT^{(n)}\\subsetneq T^{(n+1)}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal S_n\\nvdash C_n\n\\land\\mathcal S_{n+1}\\vdash C_n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每层包含固定 PA 的定理，因而可反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span>。对该层实际选用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{T^{(n)}}\">\\(B_{T^{(n)}}\\)</span> 调用抽象第二不完备性，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n\">\\(C_n\\)</span> 不可证；下一层按构造把它加入，并由闭包单调性包含前层。前层已闭合，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n\">\\(C_n\\)</span> 在其中，必可证，故包含严格。</p>\n<p>关键附加条件是每层选用谓词的 HBL 性质。仅说“这是算术化的一致性句”或“系统扩张 PA”，不能替任意标准模型正确谓词证明 P2/P3。逐层相容性也作为前提保留，不由基理论相容性推出。</p>\n<p>此结论是本地的条件推论；不归称为书中已发展的“Gödel 一致性层级”。它也未给出后层一致性在早期层内不可证的统一证明翻译。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；条件层级推论为本地扩展。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"466c532d80d46a83","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonalizable-system","status":"resolved","id":"cb62be5b9aab48d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"1f22fd0f606ee7bd","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$、$B_{T^{(n)}}$、$\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)$ 是[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]的所选迭代。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"B_{T^{(n)}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_n=\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})","display":false},{"tex":"C_n=\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)=\\neg\\Box_{B_{T^{(n)}}}\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Bigl[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S_n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S_n}(B_{T^{(n)}})\\land\n\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S_n))\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow{}&\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\nT^{(n)}\\subsetneq T^{(n+1)}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathcal S_n\\nvdash C_n\n\\land\\mathcal S_{n+1}\\vdash C_n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"B_{T^{(n)}}","display":false},{"tex":"C_n","display":false},{"tex":"C_n","display":false}],"bytes":2489,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"任意所选系统和谓词的一致性句见[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]。[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]与[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy]]是附有额外条件的本地扩展。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["3ccc8054e82f6b5d","09b80989dbe14044","87dbd27955ecb3b6","466c532d80d46a83","cb62be5b9aab48d1","c7befd96bd551ade","1f22fd0f606ee7bd"]}